    "The pattern has a token minivu doesn’t know: %@. Use {name}, {#}, {date}, {modified}, {width}, {height} or {ext}." : {
      "comment" : "Shortcuts error; %@ is a rename pattern token such as {nmae}. Keep the {…} tokens as they are",
      "localizations" : {
        "bn" : {
